# A rule over global reference facts only: no collection is scoped to the
# subject. Its search function used to leave `$subject` unused, which
# TypeDB refuses, so such a rule could not be deployed at all.

rule scoping.any-goal v0.1
says "At least one goal node is marked in the shared catalog."

subject sample

collection goals : goal-mark

conclude AnyGoal when
  some goal-mark g in goals
